    "explanation": "To both parties: the SGD 6.00 cancellation fee stands and the driver is paid SGD 4.80. Under POL-NS-01 a no-show fee is chargeable only if all four conditions hold, and on this record they do. (a) The trip record carries the driver's 'arrived' event at 23:13:10. (b) The GPS trace places him inside the 150 m AIRPORT arrival radius from 23:12:45 — 25 seconds before that event — on 63 qualifying fixes, satisfying POL-NS-02. (c) He then held position continuously inside the geofence for 620 seconds, measured from the first qualifying in-geofence fix and not from the tap, against the 480-second AIRPORT minimum: a surplus of 140 seconds, not a shortfall. (d) He terminated at 23:23:20 on reason code RIDER_NO_SHOW, after the dwell elapsed, with no boarding event. The rider's own concession on this arithmetic is recorded, and POL-NS-06 therefore gives her nothing.\n\nNo rider-exonerating clause applies. POL-NS-04 requires the rider to have sent a locating or coordinating message during the waiting window; the chat log contains none — all three messages are the system arrival notice or the driver's own, and in_app_calls is empty. That limb fails, so the clause cannot be run even though limb (c) is undecidable: all 88 rider fixes fall outside the 25 m accuracy filter, and under POL-NS-04 that is neutral, not evidence the rider was elsewhere. I accept the rider's account that she was in the terminal and saw the driver's messages only later, and that the messages were delivered but never read; that account does not meet POL-NS-04(a), which requires a message from her, and no limb of POL-NS-01 asks where the rider was. POL-NS-05 does not apply — at the arrival timestamp the driver was already stationary inside the geofence, and even on recomputation the dwell is 620 seconds. POL-NS-03 does not apply — the entire hold was inside the 150 m radius, closest approach 22.4 m, so there is no wrong-entrance refund and no pin-ambiguity goodwill. The missing traffic advisory (EV-ADVIS-00202-01, MISSING, weight 0.0) is asserted by neither side and is not needed, the hold being one continuous interval.\n\nPOL-NS-07: with POL-NS-01 satisfied in full and nothing from POL-NS-03 to POL-NS-06 displacing it, the driver is compensated at 80% of the SGD 6.00 fee, SGD 4.80. The anti-farming check does not trip — one no-show termination across 168 completed trips in the trailing 30 days is far below both the count of 4 and the rate of 0.08, and only the two fields POL-NS-07 names were used. POL-NS-08(d) is satisfied: the SGD 6.00 charged is the greater of the SGD 6.00 AIRPORT zone-class fee and the SGD 4.00 RYDE_X vehicle-tier fee, and it reconciles with the fare breakdown.\n\nImpairment and confidence: EV-CHAT-00202 is impaired at weight 0.85 (UNREAD_MESSAGE) and EV-DPROF-00202 at weight 0.9 (SCHEMA_VERSION_MISMATCH). Neither carries the deciding fact — the driver's arrival and dwell — which is carried by EV-GPS-00202 and EV-TRIP-00202, both at weight 1.0 and independent of each other, so the confidence cap is 1.0 and the findings survive the discounts. No POL-NS-09 trigger fires and the case is not escalated.\n\nDisposition under POL-GEN-03: the ruling is DRIVER_COMPENSATION, with amount_sgd and driver_compensation_sgd both SGD 4.80; the rider's SGD 6.00 charge stands as charged."
